    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lightweight hook interface for emitting Prometheus / OTel metrics.</para>
<para>Implement this interface and call <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_statistics_collector_1a8ee11e360cf8eab119ff9f712968b564" kindref="member">setMetricsHook()</ref> to receive real-time stats events. A no-op default implementation is used when not set.</para>
<para>Metric names follow the <computeroutput>themis_stats_*</computeroutput> convention:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>themis_stats_collection_duration_ms</computeroutput> – time for one full scan</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>themis_stats_cache_hits_total</computeroutput> – in-memory cache hits</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>themis_stats_errors_total</computeroutput> – collection errors </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
